## Slide 6 — Technology, trust and safeguards

## AI explains. Code calculates. Evidence supports.

Data layer

Collect company financial statements and relevant business information from traceable sources.

Python screening engine

Calculate ratios deterministically and compare them with the selected methodology.

AI explanation layer

Summarise the outcome using available evidence, without generating unsupported financial figures.

### Built with safeguards

- Missing data → Needs review
- Failed screening checks → Clearly explained
- Source and reporting date → Visible
- Religious interpretation → Not presented as an automatic fatwa

What you say (60 seconds):

